    WAVEFUNCTION SUMMARY
  ------------------------

  MO formalism                     : Restricted
  Calculation type                 : KS-DFT
    (single det. built from the Kohn-Sham orbitals)
  Number of atoms                  : 8
  Number of basis functions        : 160
  Primitive gaussians              : 206
  Spin density (FChk)              : not found, reconstructed from MOs
  Occupied MOs (nocc/alpha/beta)   : 9 / 9 / 9
  SCF/DFT energy (au)              :       -79.8656133777

  -----------------
    INPUT SUMMARY
  -----------------

  # METHOD
  --------
  Atomic partitioning (real-space)     : TFVC (Topological Fuzzy Voronoi Cells)
  Energy decomposition                 : ENPART (one- and two-center IQA terms, see below)

  # ENPART
  --------
  Functional              : B3LYP (hybrid)
  Atom-pair skip threshold: THREBOD = 5
  Two-electron grid       : MOD-GRIDTWOEL (user-selected integration grid)

